Comment: 9,0:23:29.14,0:23:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Subtitles: Thomas Chaumont
Dialogue: 9,0:00:00.77,0:00:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We finally found them!
Dialogue: 9,0:00:02.86,0:00:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's Star Platinum!
Dialogue: 9,0:00:04.74,0:00:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolyne Kujo.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:06.57,0:00:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,She defeated the guard all by herself\Nand retrieved the discs?
Dialogue: 9,0:00:16.54,0:00:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give my father his disc back.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:19.79,0:00:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll also get him the disc\Nheld by Whitesnake,
Dialogue: 9,0:00:22.84,0:00:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,no matter what it costs me.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:25.80,0:00:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:27.10,0:00:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,All the memories concerning me\Nhave been erased from Miraschon's disc.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:32.64,0:00:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Therefore,\Nno one will be able to trace it back to me.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:35.97,0:00:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Humans and animals\Nare not equal.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:38.69,0:00:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Humans, on the other hand, seek paradise.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:43.73,0:00:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Humans seek to live a life\Nthat leads them to paradise.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:48.07,0:00:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what makes humans beautiful.
Dialogue: 9,0:02:26.17,0:02:28.42,TiretsDefault,,736,0,0,,{\an7}– Soap.\N– Here's my rent.
Dialogue: 9,0:02:28.63,0:02:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I want your most expensive watch.
Dialogue: 9,0:02:31.80,0:02:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of the way.
Dialogue: 9,0:02:34.01,0:02:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to make a phone call.
Dialogue: 9,0:02:35.89,0:02:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 9,0:02:37.39,0:02:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you crazy, you skank?\NI'll take care of your dirty...
Dialogue: 9,0:02:44.69,0:02:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's a stool. See you soon!
Dialogue: 9,0:02:50.57,0:02:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And here's a drink on the house.
Dialogue: 9,0:02:53.65,0:02:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't hesitate to ask me again.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:07.71,0:03:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is the Speedwagon Foundation\Nin Dallas, Texas.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:03:12.05,0:03:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We don't accept collect calls\Nat this number.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:03:15.43,0:03:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I found this number in the directory.\NIt's the only one I have.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:19.51,0:03:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm an inmate
Dialogue: 9,0:03:21.27,0:03:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,at Green Dolphin Street\NState Prison, in Florida.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:24.77,0:03:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Jolyne Kujo.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:26.98,0:03:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Put me through to someone\Nwho understands what that means.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:30.73,0:03:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Please hold.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:03:36.49,0:03:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Thank you for waiting.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:03:38.78,0:03:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Are you the daughter\Nof Professor Jotaro Kujo?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:03:41.79,0:03:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And you are?
Dialogue: 9,0:03:43.08,0:03:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I merely represent the Foundation.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:03:45.66,0:03:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm not a Stand user.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:03:48.46,0:03:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:49.88,0:03:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But you seem to know\Nwhat Stands are.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:52.34,0:03:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you heard about the discs?
Dialogue: 9,0:03:55.05,0:03:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yes, of course.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:03:57.05,0:04:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Professor Jotaro Kujo's body\Nwas indeed delivered to us.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:04:01.35,0:04:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Not here in Dallas,\Nbut in another city,{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:04:04.52,0:04:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}after the submarine's arrival.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:04:08.60,0:04:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm sorry to have to inform you,{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:04:12.11,0:04:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but your father shows no response\Non the medical level.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:04:17.07,0:04:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,If I tell you he can be brought back to life,\Nwill you believe me?
Dialogue: 9,0:04:21.41,0:04:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm just a scientist.\NI make no comments.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:04:24.79,0:04:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I retrieved a disc.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:26.54,0:04:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Just one.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:27.60,0:04:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,He can be brought back to life.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:29.42,0:04:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,All I know\Nis that the disc has that power.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:33.38,0:04:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do whatever it takes\Nto get it to you.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:36.55,0:04:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't know how.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:38.97,0:04:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to organize something\Nto retrieve the disc.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:43.39,0:04:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Immediately.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:45.01,0:04:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Isn't this conversation\Nbeing recorded by the prison?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:04:49.31,0:04:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably, yes.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:51.48,0:04:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm willing to take that risk.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:53.90,0:04:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,No time to be subtle.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:55.36,0:04:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in a damn hurry, got it?
Dialogue: 9,0:04:58.03,0:05:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nowhere\NI can hide the disc.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:03.37,0:05:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,There must be a way.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:05.58,0:05:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way,
Dialogue: 9,0:05:06.83,0:05:10.08,TiretsDefault,,633,0,0,,– I'm not allowed any visits.\N{\i1}– I understand.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:05:10.21,0:05:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Since you insist...{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:05:13.50,0:05:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The courtyard, perhaps?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:05:15.13,0:05:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The courtyard?
Dialogue: 9,0:05:16.92,0:05:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The one that separates\Nthe men's and women's prisons?
Dialogue: 9,0:05:20.51,0:05:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yes.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:05:21.64,0:05:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Be there in 20 minutes.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:05:24.10,0:05:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We'll find a way.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:05:25.81,0:05:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,In 20 minutes?
Dialogue: 9,0:05:28.31,0:05:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now?
Dialogue: 9,0:05:29.98,0:05:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yes. You said it was urgent.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:05:32.60,0:05:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If you want us to retrieve the disc,\Nwe'll do everything we can.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:05:36.70,0:05:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I trust you when you say\Nhe can be brought back to life.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:05:40.32,0:05:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}However,{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:05:41.61,0:05:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}we are a medical foundation,\Nnot a military one.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:05:45.41,0:05:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We have neither the resources{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:05:47.16,0:05:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}nor the capacity to break you out\Nor to protect your life.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:05:51.71,0:05:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Do you accept these conditions?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:05:54.83,0:05:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. I'll be there.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:57.34,0:06:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,How will you retrieve the disc?
Dialogue: 9,0:06:00.26,0:06:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Let's not talk about that on the phone.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:06:03.30,0:06:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Look for Savage Garden.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:06:06.89,0:06:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You'll understand.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:06:09.27,0:06:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We'll call this operation\Nthe "Savage Garden Plan".{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:06:17.23,0:06:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Savage Garden...{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:06:19.07,0:06:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is it an object{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:06:20.78,0:06:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}or a person?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:06:22.70,0:06:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Very well.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:06:24.20,0:06:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I need to get to the courtyard.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:06:26.57,0:06:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm in the cafeteria\Nof the women's prison.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:06:28.91,0:06:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}To get to the courtyard,\NI first have to go through the gate,{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:06:32.75,0:06:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}climb the stairs at the end of the corridor,{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:06:35.08,0:06:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}take the walkway upstairs{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:06:36.84,0:06:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}to the infirmary.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:06:39.93,0:06:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Go through.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:42.34,0:06:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,FE40536.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:44.76,0:06:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The troublemaker\Nlocked up in the punitive ward.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:47.48,0:06:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not free\Nto move around here as you please.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:01.86,0:07:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolyne.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:03.19,0:07:04.82,TiretsDefault,,828,0,0,,– Emporio.\N– Yes.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:04.95,0:07:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't touch the ball.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:13.08,0:07:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The others mustn't see us.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:15.54,0:07:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow me.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:33.22,0:07:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Emporio, these two...
Dialogue: 9,0:07:36.23,0:07:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You can trust them.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:38.73,0:07:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,He'd rather sleep in a bed,
Dialogue: 9,0:07:41.32,0:07:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,but there are none here.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:43.53,0:07:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why he reluctantly\Nsleeps in the piano.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:54.12,0:07:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I live in secret in this ghost room.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:59.46,0:08:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Ghost room?
Dialogue: 9,0:08:00.88,0:08:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that mean you...
Dialogue: 9,0:08:03.55,0:08:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Jolyne.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:05.21,0:08:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,He and I, we're alive.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:07.30,0:08:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not ghosts.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:08.89,0:08:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Touch us:\Nwe're warm, we have a pulse.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:11.97,0:08:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me carefully.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:13.64,0:08:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No ghosts live here,\Nbut the building itself is a ghost.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:21.11,0:08:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,"Ghost object", you understand?
Dialogue: 9,0:08:23.69,0:08:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This prison was renovated\Nafter a severe fire in 1984.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:28.83,0:08:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,This room was destroyed by the fire.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:32.66,0:08:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It belongs to the past.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:35.04,0:08:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,A ghost of the music room.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:38.04,0:08:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But, that means... Emporio...
Dialogue: 9,0:08:42.08,0:08:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,do you...
Dialogue: 9,0:08:43.63,0:08:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Since my birth,
Dialogue: 9,0:08:45.05,0:08:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been able to materialize\Nthe ghosts of objects.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:48.51,0:08:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my Stand.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:51.34,0:08:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can only manipulate them.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:54.41,0:08:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,For example, this chocolate bar\Nand this orange juice...
Dialogue: 9,0:09:01.15,0:09:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't consume them.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:03.40,0:09:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But they still have taste.\NDelicious, even.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:12.16,0:09:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:13.62,0:09:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This clock stopped\Nduring the fire.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:17.69,0:09:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You still have time\Nbefore the 20 minutes are up.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:20.89,0:09:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 9,0:09:23.29,0:09:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,you talked about the disc on the phone.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:26.51,0:09:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What a risk!
Dialogue: 9,0:09:28.26,0:09:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand your situation.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:30.93,0:09:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Whitesnake will learn about it.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:34.76,0:09:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Emporio.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:36.31,0:09:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me how to get to the courtyard.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:38.85,0:09:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get me wrong.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:40.52,0:09:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't go wherever I want\Nfrom this ghost room.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:44.40,0:09:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I use ghost objects,\Nlike this one,
Dialogue: 9,0:09:48.32,0:09:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,to sneak around without getting caught.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:51.90,0:09:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you have no choice.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:54.62,0:09:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,He wants to go with you.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:58.37,0:09:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Take him with you.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:00.04,0:10:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll be able to help you.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:01.79,0:10:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,His name is Weather Report.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:11.09,0:10:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a music room.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:15.59,0:10:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be afraid.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:18.56,0:10:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Weather doesn't talk much\Nbecause he has no memory.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:22.40,0:10:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,No memory?
Dialogue: 9,0:10:24.35,0:10:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. No childhood memories\Nor memories of arriving here.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:29.48,0:10:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,He got six years for it.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:32.07,0:10:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He walks on tiptoe.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:34.99,0:10:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,A TV program enthusiast,\Nhe never watches it.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:37.78,0:10:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,When he speaks, it's softly.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:40.33,0:10:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So he gets very close.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:42.75,0:10:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll feel his warm breath.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:45.54,0:10:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He has no memory?
Dialogue: 9,0:10:47.21,0:10:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Did Whitesnake steal it?
Dialogue: 9,0:10:50.26,0:10:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:51.55,0:10:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He wants to learn who he is.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:54.43,0:10:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He also wants to know why Whitesnake\Nwants your father's discs.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:04.23,0:11:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,He says his Stand has nothing\Nto do with the discs.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:10.07,0:11:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He was born a Stand user.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:12.86,0:11:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,His power...
Dialogue: 9,0:11:17.82,0:11:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,is the ability to control the weather at will.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:22.04,0:11:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,His Stand is called...
Dialogue: 9,0:11:26.46,0:11:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Weather Report.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:47.85,0:11:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretend\Nyou didn't notice.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:54.53,0:11:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone took a peek\Nto see where the music was coming from.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:59.99,0:12:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's confirmed.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:02.49,0:12:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone is acting
Dialogue: 9,0:12:05.41,0:12:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,against you.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:08.54,0:12:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And we know what he looks like.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:32.69,0:12:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! He's getting closer.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:36.20,0:12:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If he's a Stand user,
Dialogue: 9,0:12:39.03,0:12:41.57,TiretsDefault,,474,0,0,,– we have to deal with him right now!\N– No, Jolyne.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:41.66,0:12:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to hide, for now.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:43.91,0:12:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't know you have to go\Nto the courtyard.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:47.78,0:12:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't know what you were talking about\Non the phone,
Dialogue: 9,0:12:49.96,0:12:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,that's why he was spying on us.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:52.67,0:12:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,If he had known,\Nhe would have waited for you in the courtyard.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:56.43,0:12:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why, for now,
Dialogue: 9,0:12:59.01,0:13:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,he's chasing us.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:05.43,0:13:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with him?
Dialogue: 9,0:13:07.14,0:13:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn there, before he gets closer.\NQuick!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:29.20,0:13:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:31.87,0:13:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't know
Dialogue: 9,0:13:34.42,0:13:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,where you're going.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:37.93,0:13:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But what's wrong with him?
Dialogue: 9,0:13:40.47,0:13:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,He runs strangely.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:43.14,0:13:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We could hide because he's slow.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:46.77,0:13:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way,\Nyou have to get to the courtyard.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:50.89,0:13:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if this phone call\Nwas most likely recorded,
Dialogue: 9,0:13:54.19,0:13:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Whitesnake doesn't know\Nabout it yet.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:57.57,0:14:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The faster you get there,\Nthe safer you'll be.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:00.57,0:14:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's the infirmary.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:02.95,0:14:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Go down one floor,\Ngo through the examination rooms,
Dialogue: 9,0:14:05.37,0:14:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,cross the gate, then the walkway
Dialogue: 9,0:14:07.87,0:14:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,leading to the workshop.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:09.54,0:14:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The courtyard also opens\Nonto the men's prison.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:12.46,0:14:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The infirmary serves\Nthe men as well as the women.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:15.59,0:14:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Weather Report is a man,
Dialogue: 9,0:14:17.80,0:14:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,so if a guard orders him\Nto return to his cell,
Dialogue: 9,0:14:20.34,0:14:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,he can simply\Ngo through the walkway
Dialogue: 9,0:14:23.14,0:14:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,and through the workshop entrance.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:25.47,0:14:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:27.30,0:14:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to bribe the guards.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:30.64,0:14:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I need 50 dollars.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:32.11,0:14:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell them you want\Nto have your shoes repaired at the workshop.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:35.40,0:14:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,But even if you make it through\Nthe infirmary like that,
Dialogue: 9,0:14:38.28,0:14:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll be stuck at the workshop.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:39.78,0:14:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll have to get to the courtyard\Nby forcing your way through.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:43.07,0:14:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,There aren't many guards,
Dialogue: 9,0:14:46.12,0:14:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,but if they find you,\Nyou'll get five more years.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:49.12,0:14:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,"Forcing my way through."
Dialogue: 9,0:14:51.58,0:14:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to learn\Nto love that expression.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:54.62,0:14:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No choice anyway.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:56.13,0:15:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Five more years,\Nthat's nothing at this point.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:00.63,0:15:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Emporio.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:03.76,0:15:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the least I can do.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:05.76,0:15:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring him back to life.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:08.97,0:15:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,If your father comes back to life,
Dialogue: 9,0:15:11.10,0:15:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I think
Dialogue: 9,0:15:12.60,0:15:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be able to feel more optimistic.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:23.57,0:15:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 9,0:15:24.91,0:15:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is he doing this?
Dialogue: 9,0:15:26.95,0:15:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You touched the can, didn't you?
Dialogue: 9,0:15:31.08,0:15:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you shake it?
Dialogue: 9,0:15:33.71,0:15:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Go get me another one, will you?
Dialogue: 9,0:15:35.71,0:15:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't touch it.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:38.17,0:15:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I only touched the plate.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:43.21,0:15:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,My shoe has a hole in it.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:45.47,0:15:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,There. You see?
Dialogue: 9,0:15:47.89,0:15:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to have it repaired at the workshop.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:53.14,0:15:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,There's soda everywhere.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:55.73,0:15:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did I put that rag?
Dialogue: 9,0:16:09.24,0:16:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,"Go get me a soda"?
Dialogue: 9,0:16:10.95,0:16:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really want me\Nto bring you one?
Dialogue: 9,0:16:14.79,0:16:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And pour it into this glass?
Dialogue: 9,0:16:17.25,0:16:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll do it yourself, yes!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:36.35,0:16:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What's going on?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:16:38.94,0:16:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, there's the rag.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:41.48,0:16:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You can go. Come back in 20 minutes.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:46.03,0:16:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, she's already gone.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:48.95,0:16:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But where are my glass and my plate?
Dialogue: 9,0:16:51.95,0:16:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 9,0:16:54.62,0:16:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be...
Dialogue: 9,0:16:59.50,0:17:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is...{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:17:01.21,0:17:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The plate is floating in the air!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:17:03.88,0:17:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The glass and the shoe too.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:17:05.30,0:17:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The contents of the glass aren't spilling.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:17:08.97,0:17:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They're not falling.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:17:10.93,0:17:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Everything I touch\Nfloats upward!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:17:15.81,0:17:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This bill is coming out of the guard's pocket?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:17:19.90,0:17:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm floating too.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:17:22.69,0:17:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Since when?\NWhen that guy was chasing us,{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:17:26.73,0:17:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}he spat at us.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:17:29.53,0:17:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Could that be it?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:17:31.32,0:17:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The disc.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:17:33.99,0:17:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It came out\Nwhen I spun around!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:17:36.83,0:17:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Stone Free!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:39.58,0:17:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't control my thread!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:42.42,0:17:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There's no more up or down.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:17:44.71,0:17:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There's no more gravity!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:17:46.80,0:17:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm in zero gravity!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:17:49.18,0:17:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You're entering the men's prison?
Dialogue: 9,0:17:51.93,0:17:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine. Go ahead.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:00.31,0:18:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This sucks. He's going to take my disc!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:02.65,0:18:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If I try to hit him,\NI'll lose my balance.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:18:06.61,0:18:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I need to focus.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:18:08.49,0:18:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Aim in a single direction,\Nlike a rocket!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:18:20.50,0:18:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 9,0:18:27.46,0:18:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it. I can't destroy this disc.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:32.42,0:18:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It's going back to its original shape.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:34.43,0:18:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Like rubber.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:36.26,0:18:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why he only\Nordered me to bring it to him,
Dialogue: 9,0:18:39.60,0:18:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,that Whitesnake.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:44.44,0:18:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:49.11,0:18:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Weather Report,
Dialogue: 9,0:18:50.57,0:18:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,don't go any farther!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:52.03,0:18:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me? I was attacked!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:54.53,0:18:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He took my disc.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:18:56.37,0:18:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If we lose track of him, it's all over.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:18:59.04,0:19:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Everything will be lost!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:19:01.41,0:19:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't let him get away!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:19:03.62,0:19:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No...{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:19:05.08,0:19:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}My voice can't reach him.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:19:15.76,0:19:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What a bother.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:18.05,0:19:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'll only have to kill you,\NJolyne Kujo.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:25.94,0:19:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Jumpin' Jack Flash!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:29.69,0:19:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Weather Report, watch out.\NHis power cancels gravity.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:33.66,0:19:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't touch anything he throws at you.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:36.62,0:19:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Or you'll end up weightless!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:38.99,0:19:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,In zero gravity.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:41.04,0:19:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're a Stand user too.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:43.29,0:19:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You understand, then,
Dialogue: 9,0:19:46.29,0:19:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,what my power implies.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:54.59,0:19:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,He threw
Dialogue: 9,0:19:57.26,0:19:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,some filth.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:00.76,0:20:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Weather Report.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:20:02.39,0:20:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This man who can control the weather{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:20:06.31,0:20:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}is a mystery to me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:20:08.02,0:20:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But this cloud-like thing\Nmust be a layer of air.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:20:12.36,0:20:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He used its resistance\Nto deflect the enemy's attack.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:20:15.91,0:20:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And he uses centrifugal force\Nto spin his arm.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:20:19.49,0:20:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He has no weight,{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:20:20.91,0:20:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}so he accelerates as he spins.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:20:23.80,0:20:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}His center of gravity doesn't shift,{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:20:26.21,0:20:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}so he can deliver his attack\Nwith power and precision.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:20:33.09,0:20:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Jumpin' Jack Flash!
Dialogue: 9,0:20:34.80,0:20:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Weather Report!
Dialogue: 9,0:20:39.97,0:20:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That flame!
Dialogue: 9,0:20:41.93,0:20:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Aerodynamic friction!
Dialogue: 9,0:20:43.44,0:20:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Good God, it's spreading!
Dialogue: 9,0:20:46.77,0:20:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Zero gravity, deactivation!
Dialogue: 9,0:20:51.35,0:20:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You're finished!
Dialogue: 9,0:20:52.90,0:20:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Corridor 7B.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:20:54.61,0:20:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Emergency alert activated.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:20:58.86,0:21:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Good God. That impact...
Dialogue: 9,0:21:01.62,0:21:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I almost had the disc!
Dialogue: 9,0:21:04.04,0:21:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The corridor is closing.\NWhat do I do now?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:21:06.71,0:21:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Getting to the courtyard\Njust got even harder.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:21:09.43,0:21:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But I have no choice.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:21:11.67,0:21:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The enemy will be locked in too.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:21:13.17,0:21:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's my chance to get the disc back!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:21:23.68,0:21:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 9,0:21:27.06,0:21:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything you touch...
Dialogue: 9,0:21:30.02,0:21:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,is freed from gravity, I believe.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:33.77,0:21:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I wrong, Jolyne Kujo?
Dialogue: 9,0:21:55.79,0:21:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The courtyard is right in front of me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:21:58.39,0:22:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But where is he?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:22:01.59,0:22:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have to get the disc back!{\i0}
